{
  "title": "Ziyarat of Hazrat Abu Talib (a.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سَيِّدَ الْبَطْحَآءِ وَابْنَ رَئِيْسِهَا \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAYYEDAL BATHAAA-E WAB NA RA-EESEHAA\nPeace be upon you, O master of al-Batha' (Mecca) and son of its chieftain!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَارِثَ الْكَعْبَةِ بَعْدَ تَاْسِيْسِهَا \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAARESAL KA’BATE BA’DA TA-SEESEHAA \nPeace be upon you, O heir to the Kaaba after its founding!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا كَافِلَ رَسُوْلِ اللهِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA KAAFELA RASOOLIL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O guardian and protector of the Messenger of Allah!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حَافِظَ دِيْنِ اللهِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HAAFEZA DEENIL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O preserver of the religion of Allah!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَمَّ الْمُصْطَفٰى \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA A’MMAL MUSTAFAA \nPeace be upon you, O uncle of al-Mustafa (the Chosen One)!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اَبَا الْمُرْتَضٰى \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAL MURTAZAA \nPeace be upon you, O father of al-Murtada (the Pleased One)!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَالِدَ الْاَئِمَّةِ الْهُدٰى \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WAALEDAL A-IMMATIL HODAA \nPeace be upon you, O father of the Imams of guidance!\nكَفَاكَ بِمَا اَوْلَاكَ اللهُ شَرَفًا وَّ نَسَبًا \nKAFAAKA BEMAAA AWLAAKAL LAAHO SHARAFANW WA NASABANW \nSufficient for you is the honor and lineage \nوَّ حَسْبُكَ بِمَا اَعْطَاكَ اللهُ عِزًّا وَّ حَسَبًا \nWA HASBOKA BEMAAA A’TAAKAL LAAHO I’ZZANW WA HASABAN \nwith which Allah favored you, and enough for you is the might and nobility that Allah granted you!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا شَرَفَ الْوُجُوْدِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SHARAFAL WOJOODE \nPeace be upon you, O honor of existence!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَ لِىَّ الْمَعْبُوْدِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WALIYYAL MA’BOODE \nPeace be upon you, O close loyalist (wali) of the One Worthy of Worship!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حَارِسَ النَّبِىِّ الْمَوْعُوْدِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HAARESAN NABIYYIL MAW-O’ODE \nPeace be upon you, O guardian of the Promised Prophet!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَنْ رُزِقَ وَلَدٌ هُوَ خَيْرُ مَوْلُوْدٍ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MAN ROZEQA WALADUN HOWA KHAYRO MAWLOODIN \nPeace be upon you, O one who was blessed with a son who is the best of all newborns!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَنْ خُصِّصَ بِالْوَلَدِ الزَّكِىِّ الطَّاهِرِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MAN KHUSSESA BIL-WALADIZ ZAKIYYIT TAAHIRIL \nPeace be upon you, O one who was specially graced with the pure, spotless, \nالْمُطَهَّرِ الْعَلِىٍّ اشْتُقَّ اسْمُهٗ مِنَ الْعَلِىِّ \nMOTAHHARIL A’LIYYENISH TUQQAS MOHU MENAL A’LIYYE \npurified, and exalted child whose name was derived from the Most High (al-Ali)!\nهَنِيْئًا لَّكَ ثُمَّ هَنِيْئًا لَّكَ مِنْ وَّلَدٍ \nHANEEE-AL LAKA SUMMA HANEEE-AL LAKA MINW WALADIN \nMay congratulations and joy be yours, and again congratulations and joy be yours, \nهُوَ الْمُرْتَضٰى مِنْ رَسُوْلٍ وَّ اَخُ الرَّسُوْلِ \nHOWAL MURTAZAA MIR RASOOLINW WA AKHUR RASOOLE \nfor having a son who is the approved choice (al-Murtada) by the Messenger, the brother of the Messenger, \nوَ زَوْجُ الْبَتُوْلِ وَ سَيْفُ اللهِ الْمَسْلُوْلُ \nWA ZAWJUL BATOOLE WA SAYFUL LAAHIL MASLOOLO \nthe husband of the Chaste Maiden (al-Batul), and the drawn sword of Allah!\nهَنِيْئًا لَّكَ ثُمَّ هَنِيْئًا لَّكَ مِنْ وَّلَدٍ \nHANEEE-AL LAKA SUMMA HANEEE-AL LAKA MINW WALADIN \nMay congratulations and joy be yours, and again congratulations and joy be yours, for having a son \nهُوَ مِنْ مُّحَمَّدٍ الْمُصْطَفٰى \nHOWA MIM MOHAMMADENIL MUSTAFAA \nwhose station to Muhammad al-Mustafa \nبِمَنْزِلَةِ هَارُوْنَ مِنْ مُوْسٰى \nBE-MANZELATE HAAROONA MIM MOOSAA \nis as the station of Haroon to Moosa!\nهَنِيْئًا لَّكَ مِنْ وَّلَدٍ هُوَ شَرِيْكُ النُّبُوَّةِ \nHANEEE-AL LAKA MINW WALADIN HOWA SHAREEKUN NOBUWWATE \nMay congratulations and joy be yours for having a son who is the partner in the prophetic mission, \nوَ الْمَخْصُوْصُ بِالْاُخُوَّةِ \nWAL MAKHSOOSO BIL-OKHUWWATE \nthe one uniquely chosen for brotherhood, \nوَ كَاشِفُ الْغُمَّةِ وَ اِمَامُ الْاُمَّةِ وَ اَبُوْ الْاَئِمَّةِ \nWA KAASHEFUL GHUMMATE WA EMAAMUL UMMATE WA ABUL A-IMMATE \nthe remover of sorrow, the leader (imam) of the nation, and the father of the Imams!\nهَنِيْئًا لَّكَ مِنْ وَّ لَدٍ هُوَ قَسِيْمُ الْجَنَّةِ وَ النَّارِ \nHANEEE-AL LAKA MINW WALADIN HOWA QASEEMUL JANNATE WAN NAARE \nMay congratulations and joy be yours for having a son who is the distributor of Paradise and Hellfire, \nوَ نِعْمَةُ اللهِ عَلَى الْاَبْرَارِ \nWA NE’MATUL LAAHE A’LAL ABRAARE \nthe blessing of Allah upon the righteous, \nوَ نَقِمَةُ اللهِ عَلَى الْفُجَّارِ \nWA NAQEMATUL LAAHE A’LAL FUJ-JAARE \nand the wrath of Allah upon the wicked!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ وَ عَلَيْهِ وَ عَلَيْهِمْ اَجْمَعِيْنَ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA WA A’LAYHE WA A’LAYHIM AJMA-E’ENA \nPeace be upon you, and upon him, and upon all of them, \nوَ رَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU.\nand the mercy of Allah and His blessings! "
}
